(1. ARBITRATION JURISDICTION) '
(This petition under Section 9 of the Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996 seeks interim protective orders.) '
T*
(2. RATIO & ANALYSIS) '
(Interim Relief in Commercial Arbitration: Courts exercising Section 9 powers must ensure balance of convenience and preservation of res pending the constitution of the Arbitral Tribunal. Unilateral bank guarantee invocation restrained.) '
T*
(3. OPERATIVE DIRECTION) '
(Petition is disposed of. No order as to costs.) '
T*
([Signed]) '
(G.S. Kulkarni \(J\)) '
